reply:
This surface puts a status filter above a sortable list of eight items. Each item has a title, a status, and a one-line detail.

<a2ui-json>
[
  {
    "version": "v0.9",
    "createSurface": {
      "surfaceId": "status-list",
      "catalogId": "https://a2uicatalog.ai/catalog/c-data-display.json"
    }
  },
  {
    "version": "v0.9",
    "updateComponents": {
      "surfaceId": "status-list",
      "components": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "component": "columns",
          "cols": 1,
          "gap": "1rem",
          "align": "stretch",
          "items": [
            {
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "list_heading",
                  "component": "heading",
                  "text": "Launch Checklist"
                },
                {
                  "id": "status_filter",
                  "component": "segmented_control",
                  "name": "status_filter",
                  "selected_value": "all",
                  "options": "[{\"label\": \"All (8)\", \"value\": \"all\"}, {\"label\": \"Done (3)\", \"value\": \"done\"}, {\"label\": \"In progress (2)\", \"value\": \"in_progress\"}, {\"label\": \"Blocked (1)\", \"value\": \"blocked\"}, {\"label\": \"Not started (2)\", \"value\": \"not_started\"}]"
                },
                {
                  "id": "status_legend",
                  "component": "lozenge",
                  "items": [
                    { "text": "Done", "appearance": "success" },
                    { "text": "In progress", "appearance": "inprogress" },
                    { "text": "Blocked", "appearance": "removed" },
                    { "text": "Not started", "appearance": "default" }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "items_table",
                  "component": "data_table_sortable",
                  "headers": ["Title", "Status", "Detail"],
                  "rows": [
                    ["Domain & DNS setup", "Done", "Records verified and propagated across all regions."],
                    ["Brand assets", "Done", "Logo, palette and type scale signed off by design."],
                    ["Pricing page copy", "Done", "Final copy approved by marketing on Monday."],
                    ["Payment integration", "In progress", "Webhook handling complete; refunds still pending."],
                    ["Onboarding flow", "In progress", "Steps two and three are in usability testing."],
                    ["Security review", "Blocked", "Waiting on the vendor's penetration test report."],
                    ["Help center articles", "Not started", "Outline drafted; writers start next sprint."],
                    ["Launch announcement", "Not started", "Scheduled once the security review clears."]
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
]
</a2ui-json>

The filter has five options: **All**, **Done**, **In progress**, **Blocked** and **Not started**. Each option shows how many items it covers.

**The filter does not hide rows yet.** This catalog has no way to connect the filter to the table. As a workaround, the table is sortable, so sorting by the **Status** column puts items with the same status together.
